  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Behavior on live version (933): Enter a youtube link, everyone sees the video play.\nBehavior on open beta (936): Enter a youtube link, you see the video play but nobody else does.\nThis happens on both types of video players.\nHere are some worlds to test that are verified to work on 933: \nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_5b0cdd65-b06f-44e0-86b4-7cb365bdd684\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_947bad70-32eb-4097-869f-d9cb56f66a6e",
